flowchart TD
    U[User types a request] --> G1{Guardrail: check_query<br/>empty or too long?}
    G1 -- bad --> R1[Show friendly error, log warning]
    G1 -- ok --> A1

    subgraph Agent["Agent (src/agent.py)"]
        A1[Step 1 PLAN<br/>Gemini turns sentence into profile<br/>genre, mood, energy] --> A2[Step 2 USE TOOL<br/>recommend_songs scores all songs]
        A2 --> A3{Step 3 CHECK<br/>top score >= 3.0?}
        A3 -- no, tries left --> FB[Send feedback:<br/>real genre/mood pairs] --> A1
        A3 -- yes, or out of tries --> A4[Keep best attempt]
    end

    A1 -. Gemini fails .-> F1[Fallback: RAG word finder<br/>retrieve_songs]
    F1 --> A4

    DATA[(data/songs.csv<br/>18 songs)] --> A2
    DATA --> F1
    DATA -. genre and mood choices .-> A1

    A4 --> S[Step 4 ANSWER<br/>DJ Vibe: few-shot specialized prompt<br/>uses ONLY retrieved songs]
    S -. Gemini fails .-> F2[Fallback: plain song list]
    S --> OUT[Answer shown to user]
    F2 --> OUT

    LOG[(app.log)]
    R1 -.-> LOG
    A1 -.-> LOG
    F1 -.-> LOG

    T[pytest: 11 tests<br/>fake Gemini] -. checks .-> G1
    T -. checks .-> A3
    T -. checks .-> F1